24
00:01:14,722 --> 00:01:16,046
Totalmente, sí.

25
00:01:17,727 --> 00:01:19,076
Sí.

26
00:01:20,283 --> 00:01:21,877
Vale, Liam, mira,

27
00:01:21,878 --> 00:01:25,495
