41
00:02:26,932 --> 00:02:28,403
<i>Vive...</i>

42
00:02:28,527 --> 00:02:29,664
<i>Respira...</i>

43
00:02:29,788 --> 00:02:30,801
<i>Huele.</i>

44
00:02:31,865 --> 00:02:33,225
<i>Memoria de espectro completo.</i>

45
00:02:33,250 --> 00:02:36,267
<i>Puedes mejorar tu grano de sauce
